        <item>
         <widget class="QPushButton" name="connectButton">
          <property name="toolTip">
           <string>Connect to each configured port of IUMA's acquisition app, or disconnect. SLIAFlow only receives; it sends nothing to the app. Disconnecting can take about 2 s per port while the app is not running.</string>
